    "520fd27cbd371a4782b0963f2add73c2e09f2a79e84761353d17fd86049710e9": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "593731f99ad36b29bc5714c4eae1af7bb8b71a8f47d2b1d87972ce453c7304a6",
      "contextFingerprint": "b1f721604ea920e338e31996dbec65328d3724b5f857787a6c054e2696eae763",
      "sourceText": "| 实车上可能看到的现象 | 先看哪些参数或条件 | 怎样理解 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 上坡或下坡远处的地面消失 | `lowerBoundZ`、`upperBoundZ`、`disRatioZ` | 它们决定相对输入雷达位置，向上、向下能保留多大的高度范围；本节点的范围会随水平距离扩大 |\n| 正常坡面、下坡被画成障碍 | `useSorting`、`quantileZ`，以及下游10 cm障碍门槛 | 每一小片区域先选地面高度，再计算点离这个高度有多远；本节点远场对高低两侧都取绝对值，正常坡的较低侧也可能过门槛 |\n| 同一障碍或坡面在4 m附近表现突然变化 | `localTerrainMapRadius` 与两个节点的规则差异 | 近场与远场的地面格子、点密度、高度上限和负高度差处理不同；要检查交接处，不能只调一边 |\n| 想排除顶棚、判断地面是否与车旁连得上 | `checkTerrainConn` 及其三个配套参数 | 当前 False，专门的连接检查和顶棚筛选没有执行；`ceilingFilteringThre=2.0` 此时不起作用 |\n| 人或障碍离开后，旧点没有在0.2秒消失 | `decayTime` 与两项 `voxel…UpdateThre` | 旧点只在缓存块更新时检查年龄；0.2秒不是准时删除的倒计时 |\n| 以为 `clearingDis=20.0` 会自动清掉20 m外的点 | 清图事件与 `clearingDis` | 它仅在外部触发时清除20 m**内**的自身缓存，平时不按这个半径清图 |",
      "translatedText": "| Phenomena possibly observed on the actual vehicle | Which parameters or conditions to check first | How to understand |\n|---|---|---|\n| The ground disappears at a distance on uphill or downhill slopes | `lowerBoundZ`、`upperBoundZ`、`disRatioZ` | They determine the relative input radar position and how much height range can be retained upward and downward; the range of this node expands with horizontal distance |\n| A normal slope or downhill is drawn as an obstacle | `useSorting`、`quantileZ`and the downstream 10 cm obstacle threshold | For each small patch of area, the ground height is first selected, then how far the point is from this height is calculated; in the far field, this node takes absolute values on both the high and low sides, so the lower side of a normal slope may also exceed the threshold |\n| The same obstacle or slope shows a sudden change near 4 m | `localTerrainMapRadius` and the rule difference between the two nodes | The ground grid, point density, height upper limit, and negative height difference handling differ between near and far fields; the transition must be checked, and adjusting only one side is not enough |\n| Want to exclude the ceiling and determine whether the ground is connected to the side of the vehicle | `checkTerrainConn` and its three supporting parameters | Currently False, so the dedicated connection check and ceiling filtering are not executed;`ceilingFilteringThre=2.0` does not take effect at this time |\n| After a person or obstacle leaves, old points do not disappear within 0\\.2 seconds | `decayTime` and two items `voxel…UpdateThre` | Old points are checked for age only when the cache block is updated; 0\\.2 seconds is not a countdown for deletion on time |\n| Think that `clearingDis=20.0` will automatically clear points beyond 20 m | Clear map event and `clearingDis` | It clears 20 m only when externally triggered**inside**of its own cache; normally it does not clear the map according to this radius |",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 410,
        "outputTokens": 361,
        "costUsd": 0.000557
      }
